# The list of the call entries that are fused into their targets is searched by unit number and by position in the code.
# Fault injection, testing=ReverseFusedCallEntries: the list is passed on in reverse order.
# AS-USERS-BUILD: the build asks in every build that the list ascend by both.
# DIAGNOSTIC: ProgramTableCheckFailed
# RUN: compile mechanisms=all testing=ReverseFusedCallEntries
# CHECK: diagnostic ProgramTableCheckFailed
# CHECK-NEXT: image empty
